bilities related to acquisitions which are measured at fair value using Level 3 inputs. The amount of contingent consideration due from or due to the sellers is based on the achievement of agreed-upon financial performance metrics by the acquired company, as determined by the terms of the contingent consideration agreements with the sellers of each acquired company. We record a liability at the time of the acquisition based on the present value of management’s best estimates of the future results of the acquired companies compared to the agreed-upon metrics. After the date of acquisition, we update the original valuation to reflect the passage of time and current projections of future results of the acquired companies. Accretion of, and changes in the valuations of, contingent consideration are reported on the condensed consolidated statement of operations within “Severance and other expense”.","context":"| | December 31, 2025 | | | Level 1 | | | Level 2 | | | Level 3 | | | Total | Assets: | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | Non-current accounts receivable, net | | $ | - | | | $ | 7,432 | | | $ | - | | | $ | 7,432 | Liabilities: | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | Contingent consideration | | | - | | | | - | | | | 9,470 | | | | 9,470 | Long-term borrowings | | | - | | | | 79,065 | | | | - | | | | 79,065 | Finance lease liabilities | | | - | | | | 15,121 | | | | - | | | | 15,121 |","section":"Business combinations and dispositions","block":136,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001437749-26-024670","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-28","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0002126198","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2126198/000143774926024670/xprol20260630_10q.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/209a1c01adb9556e0e7fc65b4c77493dfbf3f99b970bb6bcf8cef37365b32819.bin","sha256":"209a1c01adb9556e0e7fc65b4c77493dfbf3f99b970bb6bcf8cef37365b32819"}},{"id":"c0a324fe277e23d714760cdc4e388d1f3ce